  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FTF Bangladesh Quality Assurance Support Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(Bangladesh):  The FTF Bangladesh Quality Assurance Support Activity provides quality assurance surveillance, construction monitoring services, and other technical support for USAID&apos;s infrastructure investments. This activity ensures that infrastructure implemented through the FTF Bangladesh Agricultural Infrastructure Development activity is cost effective, sustainable, and complies with applicable national or international standards and codes and engineering best practices. The activity will utilize FY 2024 funds to provide services and support such as reviewing plans, technical reports, and designs; periodic monitoring of construction; third-party quality verification; and commissioning support to ensure that the FTF Bangladesh Agricultural Infrastructure Development activity complies with design specifications, including quality assurance, safety implementation, schedules, guarantees, and other contract terms and conditions. The activity supports the Global Food Security Strategy. Funding for the activity contributes to the Global Food Security ($800,000) earmark.</narrative>
  </description>
